OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed amid gas leak
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas leak being investigated by
OL,7,Ffirefighters and an energy company has
OL,8,Fcaused a series of road closures in
OL,9,FJersey.
OL,11,FSt Saviour's Hill has been shut at the
OL,12,Fjunction of Deloraine Road and St
OL,13,FSaviour's Hill, with 15 firefighters at
OL,14,Fthe scene, authorities said.
OL,16,FIsland Energy said work was "expected
OL,17,Fto remain in place for around five
OL,18,Fdays, although this may change as
OL,19,Finvestigations progress".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
